### Polls (PRD "Polling with templates"). Any member with an account votes; OWNER and EDITOR create.

### List the polls of a trip (newest first). Polls whose time ran out are settled on the way (CLOSED or TIED)
GET {{host}}/trips/{{tripId}}/polls
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create. kind: DATE PLACE STAY FOOD BUDGET DESTINATION TRANSPORT CUSTOM. BUDGET is always anonymous.
### DATE options need startDate/endDate; BUDGET options minMinor/maxMinor; the others a label.
POST {{host}}/trips/{{tripId}}/polls
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "id": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
  "kind": "STAY",
  "question": "Menginap di mana?",
  "closesAt": "2026-12-31T00:00:00Z",
  "multiChoice": false,
  "anonymous": false,
  "applyWinner": true,
  "options": [
    { "id": "22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222", "label": "Villa Ubud", "priceMinor": 750000, "priceUnit": "NIGHT", "url": "https://example.com/villa" }
  ]
}

### One poll. On an anonymous poll voterIds is always empty; votedMemberIds says who has voted
GET {{host}}/polls/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Vote (replaces your votes). version = the version of the option you saw; 409 VOTE_STALE if it changed, 409 POLL_CLOSED after closesAt
PUT {{host}}/polls/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111/votes
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{ "votes": [ { "optionId": "22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222", "version": 1 } ] }

### Add an option (also after votes), edit it (clears its votes when label, dates, link or price change), delete it
POST {{host}}/polls/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111/options
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{ "id": "33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333", "label": "Hotel Kuta", "priceMinor": 500000, "priceUnit": "NIGHT" }

###
PATCH {{host}}/polls/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111/options/33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{ "id": "33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333", "label": "Hotel Kuta", "priceMinor": 550000, "priceUnit": "NIGHT" }

###
DELETE {{host}}/polls/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111/options/33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Creator or OWNER: change the poll. anonymous can change only before the first vote (409 POLL_LOCKED)
PATCH {{host}}/polls/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{ "question": "Menginap di mana, tanggal 20?", "closesAt": "2027-01-05T00:00:00Z" }

### Close voting now
POST {{host}}/polls/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111/close
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Confirm the winner and run its action (DATE: trip dates, DESTINATION: destination, PLACE: Belum dijadwalkan, FOOD: an activity). Send {} to close without choosing
POST {{host}}/polls/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111/decide
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{ "optionId": "22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222" }

### Reopen a closed or tied poll
POST {{host}}/polls/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111/reopen
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{ "closesAt": "2027-01-05T00:00:00Z" }

### Delete
DELETE {{host}}/polls/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
